---
import Module9Behold from './Module9Behold';
import Module9Derive from './Module9Derive';
import Module9Operate from './Module9Operate';
import Module9Prompts from './Module9Prompts';
---

<div class="m m9">
  <section class="m-block m9-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Listeners don't know the key in advance. They infer it from
      the pitches they hear. Krumhansl ran probe-tone experiments in
      the 1980s — play a key context, then ask "how well does each
      pitch fit?" — and averaged the results into two vectors, one
      per mode. The bars below are those averages: the empirical
      tonal hierarchy.
    </p>
    <Module9Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m9-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      To infer a key from a passage: compute its <em>pc histogram</em>{' '}
      (each pitch class weighted by total duration), then compute
      Pearson correlation against all 24 probe-tone profiles. The
      maximally-correlated (tonic, mode) is the inferred key. Here
      the algorithm runs over the chorale's soprano line.
    </p>
    <Module9Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m9-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Build your own pc distribution. Tap pcs on the clock to add
      weight; the model re-correlates live. With only three taps —{' '}
      <code>0, 4, 7</code> — the model already picks out C major
      decisively. Try contrarian sets and watch the second-place
      contenders fight for the lead.
    </p>
    <Module9Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m9-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on the probe-tone profile and key-finding.
    </p>
    <Module9Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m9-block m-bridge m9-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      Static key inference reads one frame of the music. But music
      moves: tonal centers <em>drift</em> over time, modulating from
      one key to another. The next module reaches deeper — beyond
      surface chords to the structural skeleton.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 9 specific rules. */

  .m9-behold,
  .m9-derive,
  .m9-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m9-behold {
    cursor: pointer;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .m9-mode-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m9-mode-name {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m9-mode-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Bar charts (Behold + Derive + Operate) ----------------------------- */
  .m9-bars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    gap: 0.2rem;
    align-items: end;
    width: 100%;
    height: 9rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m9-bars-small {
    height: 5rem;
  }
  .m9-bar-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .m9-bar {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-radius: 1px 1px 0 0;
    position: relative;
    transition:
      height 0.4s ease,
      background 0.4s ease;
    min-height: 2px;
  }
  .m9-bar.tonic {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .m9-bar-value {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m9-bar-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m9-behold-caption,
  .m9-derive-caption,
  .m9-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  .m9-behold-caption em,
  .m9-derive-caption em {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Derive section labels --------------------------------------------- */
  .m9-derive-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .m9-derive-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m9-rank-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .m9-rank {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m9-rank.top {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.08);
  }
  .m9-rank-pos {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .m9-rank.top .m9-rank-pos {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m9-rank-corr {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .m9-rank.top .m9-rank-corr {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Operate ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .m9-inferred {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .m9-inferred-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m9-inferred-key {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m9-inferred-corr {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m9-operate-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m9-operate-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .m9-operate-btn:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
</style>
